<title>MALAYSIA: BADMINTON-RESULTS OF MALAYSIAN OPEN SEMINFINAL MATCHES.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-RESULTS OF MALAYSIAN OPEN SEMINFINAL MATCHES.</headline>
<dateline>KOTA KINABALU, Malaysia 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of</p>
<p>semifinal matches in the Malaysian Open badminton tournament on</p>
<p>Saturday:</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>3/4-Peter Gade Christensen (Denmark) beat 5/8-Budi Santoso</p>
<p>(Indonesia) 15-1 15-7</p>
<p>3/4-Hermawan Susanto (Indonesia) beat 1-Joko Suprianto</p>
<p>(Indonesia) 15-11 15-2</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>1-Ye Zhaoying (China) beat Zhou Mi (China) 11-3 11-5</p>
<p>2-Susi Susanti (Indonesia) beat 3-Dai Yun (China) 11-7 9-11</p>
<p>11-5</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>1-Ricky Subagja/Rexy Mainaky beat 3/4 Lee Wan Wah/Choong Tan</p>
<p>Fook (Malaysia) 15-7 15-1.</p>
<p>2-Denny Kantono/Antonius Budi (Indonesia) 3/4-Yoo Yong-sung</p>
<p>(S.Korea) beat Lee Dong-soo 15-10 15-13.</p>
<p>Mixed Doubles (finals)</p>
<p>1-Liu Yong/Gei Sei (China) beat 2-Jens Eriksen/Marlene Thomson</p>
<p>(Denmark) 15-12 15-1.</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>1-Gu Jun/Ge Fei (China) beat 3/4 Marlene Thomsen/Lisbet Stuer-Lauridsen (Denmark) 15-12 15-3</p>
<p>3/4 Liu Lu/Qiang Hong (China) beat Huang Nanyan/Liu Zhong (China) 18-15 15-8</p>
</text>
